OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, bright start across the
OL,6,Fregion. Cloud builds through the day
OL,7,Fbut remaining dry with hazy sunshine.
OL,8,FFeeling warm in the sun by mid
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds freshening through
OL,10,Fthe day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud continues to build with
OL,13,Fclearer spells in the east initially.
OL,14,FA band of rain moves across the area
OL,15,Fafter midnight and lingers into Friday
OL,16,Fmorning. Milder than last night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
