OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FDamp and cloudy to start. The
OL,6,Frain band slowly moves south to leave
OL,7,Fa mostly dry afternoon, but remaining
OL,8,Fcloudy for most into the evening.
OL,9,FTemperatures near average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDrier
OL,12,Fand brighter through Saturday. A
OL,13,Fbreezy day on Sunday, with rain
OL,14,Farriving after a fine start to the
OL,15,Fday. A further fine day on Monday.
OL,16,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
